241
00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.660
Get a microwave-safe bowl.

242
00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:42.040
Fill it with two cups of water and two tablespoons of vinegar.

243
00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:49.180
Now, side note, if you'd like, you could add a drop of your favorite essential oil if you want.

244
00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.500
If you want to be fancy.

245
00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:51.020
Yeah.

246
00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:53.460
You can clean your microwave fancy or regular.

247
00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:54.400
OK.

248
00:09:54.400 --> 00:10:00.640
Now, turn the microwave on, obviously, put the bowl in the microwave, and then put it on high for five minutes.

249
00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:02.740
You want it to get real steamy in there.

250
00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:03.140
OK.

251
